{"ticker":"F","updated":"2026-10-30T22:47:56Z","profile":{"longName":"Ford Motor Company","shortName":"Ford Motor Company","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ford.com","fullTimeEmployees":169000,"marketCap":48916914176,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":6.4183846,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.26163673,"pegRatio":8.48,"targetMeanPrice":15.28,"targetHighPrice":20.0,"targetLowPrice":12.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":18,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.02,"earningsGrowth":-0.144,"grossMargins":0.07277,"operatingMargins":0.029360002,"profitMargins":-0.041690003,"totalRevenue":186965000192,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":17.78,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":11.11,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.85},"summary":"Ford Motor Company develops, delivers, and services Ford trucks, sport utility vehicles, commercial vans and cars, and Lincoln luxury vehicles in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Mexico, and internationally. It operates through Ford Blue, Ford Model e, Ford Pro, and Ford Credit segments. The company sells Ford and Lincoln internal combustion engine and hybrid vehicles, electric vehicles, service parts, accessories, and digital services for retail customers; develops EV and digital vehicle technologies, and software; and provides telematics and EV charging solutions. It also sells Ford and Lincoln vehicles, service parts, and accessories through distributors and dealers, as well as through dealerships to commercial fleet customers, daily rental car companies, and governments. In addition, it engages in vehicle-related financing and leasing activities to and through automotive dealers. Further, the company provides retail installment sale contracts for new and used vehicles; and direct financing leases for new vehicles to retail and commercial customers, such as leasing companies, government entities, daily rental companies, and fleet customers. Additionally, it offers wholesale loans to dealers to finance the purchase of vehicle inventory; and loans to dealers to finance working capital and enhance dealership facilities, purchase dealership real estate, and other d","summary_zh":"福特汽車公司在美國、加拿大、英國、墨西哥和國際上開發、提供福特卡車、運動型多用途車、商用貨車和轎車以及林肯豪華車並提供服務。該公司透過福特 Blue、福特 Model e、福特 Pro 和福特 Credit 部門營運。該公司向零售客戶銷售福特和林肯內燃機和混合動力汽車、電動車、維修零件、配件和數位服務；開發電動車和數位汽車技術和軟體；並提供遠端資訊處理和電動車充電解決方案。它還透過經銷商和經銷商以及經銷商向商業車隊客戶、日租汽車公司和政府銷售福特和林肯汽車、維修零件和配件。此外，它還透過汽車經銷商從事與汽車相關的融資和租賃活動。此外，該公司還提供新車和二手車零售分期銷售合約；向零售和商業客戶（例如租賃公司、政府實體、日租公司和車隊客戶）提供新車直接融資租賃。此外，它還向經銷商提供批發貸款，為購買車輛庫存提供資金；以及向經銷商提供的貸款，用於籌集營運資金、增強經銷設施、購買經銷房地產等","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"汽車製造商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":11.76,"h":11.89,"l":11.64,"c":11.72,"v":57704200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":11.67,"h":11.73,"l":11.57,"c":11.62,"v":47728700},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":11.65,"h":11.7,"l":11.57,"c":11.68,"v":33136700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":11.71,"h":11.91,"l":11.66,"c":11.74,"v":47547800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":11.75,"h":11.75,"l":11.58,"c":11.69,"v":39734500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":11.67,"h":11.68,"l":11.45,"c":11.49,"v":41262700},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":11.49,"h":11.52,"l":11.31,"c":11.42,"v":47021300},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":11.46,"h":11.79,"l":11.43,"c":11.76,"v":64196100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":11.75,"h":11.81,"l":11.66,"c":11.68,"v":50100800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":11.74,"h":11.76,"l":11.61,"c":11.68,"v":47942400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":11.69,"h":11.78,"l":11.51,"c":11.61,"v":58065000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":11.63,"h":11.88,"l":11.55,"c":11.66,"v":68585900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":11.69,"h":11.78,"l":11.62,"c":11.74,"v":55040100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":11.77,"h":11.8,"l":11.59,"c":11.62,"v":71676300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":11.6,"h":11.7,"l":11.57,"c":11.66,"v":58432700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":11.7,"h":11.93,"l":11.7,"c":11.73,"v":55667600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":11.73,"h":11.83,"l":11.59,"c":11.63,"v":60193800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":11.54,"h":11.65,"l":11.37,"c":11.62,"v":67656300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o