he information about Ford and our subsidiaries contained in this Annual Report on Form 10-K for the year ended December 31, 2025 (\"2025 Form 10-K Report\" or \"Report\"), extensive information about our Company can be found at https://corporate.ford.com, including information about our management team, brands, products, services, and corporate governance principles.","zh":"除了截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的 10-K 表格年度報告（「2025 年 10-K 表格報告」或「報告」）中包含的有關福特及其子公司的資訊外，還可在 https://corporate.ford.com 上找到有關我們公司的詳細資訊，包括有關我們的管理團隊、品牌、產品、服務和服務的資訊。"},{"en":"The corporate governance information on our website includes our Corporate Governance Principles, Code of Ethics for Senior Financial Personnel, Code of Ethics for the Board of Directors, Code of Corporate Conduct for all employees, and the Charters for each of the Committees of our Board of Directors. In addition, any amendments to our Code of Ethics or waivers granted to our directors and executive officers will be posted on our corporate website. All of these documents may be accessed by going to our corporate website, or may be obtained free of charge by writing to our Shareholder Relations Department, Ford Motor Company, One American Road, P.O. Box 1899, Dearborn, Michigan 48126-1899.","zh":"我們網站上的公司治理資訊包括我們的公司治理原則、高階財務人員道德準則、董事會道德準則、所有員工的企業行為準則、董事會各委員會的章程。此外，对我们道德准则的任何修订或授予我们董事和执行官的豁免都将发布在我们的公司网站上。所有這些文件均可透過造訪我們的公司網站獲取，也可寫信至我們的股東關係部（地址：One American Road, P.O.）免費取得。信箱 1899，迪尔伯恩，密歇根州 48126-1899。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Company Excluding Ford Credit","val":173996000000,"zh":"公司不包括福特信貸"},{"name":"Ford Blue","val":101019000000,"zh":"福特藍"},{"name":"Ford Pro","val":66286000000,"zh":"福特專業版"},{"name":"Ford Credit","val":13271000000,"zh":"福特信貸"},{"name":"Ford Model E","val":6670000000,"zh":"福特E型"}],"total":187267000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"All Sales Type Products & Services","val":173749000000,"zh":"所有銷售類型產品和服務"},{"name":"Vehicles Parts & A